        <p class="provenance-note">Composed by rule from Wikidata item <a href="https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q90">Q90</a> (composition/0.3, view/0.2, design/0.2). The lead paragraph, the section paragraphs and the section links come from Wikipedia. Pictures come from Wikimedia Commons; a W on a picture marks one from an article, not from Wikidata; a W on a value marks a statement whose only reference is a Wikipedia.</p><dialog id="label-editor"
        class="label-editor"
        lang="en"
        aria-labelledby="label-editor-title"
        data-saved="Saved on this page only. This is a prototype: nothing is published.">
    <header>
        <h2 id="label-editor-title">Add the label in <span data-lang-name="en">en</span></h2>
        <button type="button"
                command="close"
                commandfor="label-editor"
                aria-label="Close">×</button>
    </header>
    <div class="fields">
        <p class="source"><span class="note source-lang"></span><span class="text"></span></p>
        <label class="note" for="label-editor-text"><span data-lang-name="en">en</span> · machine translation: correct it</label>
        <input id="label-editor-text"
               type="text"
               lang="en"
               dir="ltr"
               autocomplete="off">
    </div>
    <footer class="actions">
        <span class="status"
              role="status"
              data-translating="Translating…"
              data-failed="No machine translation: write the label."></span>
        <button class="close" type="button">Close</button>
        <button class="save" type="button">Save</button>
    </footer>
</dialog>
    </main>
